  "instructions": [
    "Preheat binchotan grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a bowl combine tofu cubes, elderflower buds, mint, rosemary, thyme, lemon zest, and lemon juice.",
    "Drizzle olive oil over the mixture and toss gently until coated.",
    "Sprinkle with sea salt and pepper, mixing again.",
    "Place the tofu mixture onto the grill grates, using a grill pan if needed.",
    "Grill for 3 minutes on each side, until lightly charred and heated through.",
    "Remove from grill and let rest for 2 minutes.",
    "Serve warm with a sprinkle of fresh herbs."
